ined sanctuaries, and nightmarish geometries. Delve through a variety of challenging dungeons, and test your might in PvP.\n\nUncover the mysteries of a dying world with hundreds of characters and an in-game glossary that expands with every new piece of lore uncovered.\n\nBuild your character with a range of origins, attributes, upgrades, and drip yourself out with a variety of customisation options.\n\n---\n\nWinner of \"Best New Experience\" Innovation Awards '22","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7493e7518773b5bd41602823fec30805/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-415c5da591b8718bf732a7e2762e6aa2/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8ce3525ac656562ed315a089275df1b2/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"],"passes":[{"id":182690769,"name":"Emote Pack 2","price":150,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-20bb545164483bc90a7d803853021009/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":113458581,"name":"Emote Pack 1","price":150,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-839a2054d2b9f2795b5a9372dfecc65d/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"}],"badges":[],"extrasAt":1794453011018}